{
  "_comment": [
    "Places the campus art labels but OpenStreetMap does not name. The footprints are in",
    "OSM - which is why the art draws them - they simply carry no name tag, and the",
    "pipeline skips anything unnamed.",
    "",
    "`at` is a point in art pixels, read off real_map.jpeg, that falls inside the shape.",
    "The build script looks up whichever unnamed building or pitch contains that point and",
    "adopts its real outline, so these get surveyed geometry rather than a hand-drawn box.",
    "If no shape contains the point the entry still becomes a place, just without an outline,",
    "and the build prints a warning.",
    "",
    "Re-read the points if the art is ever replaced."
  ],
